[00:00.000]作词 : Jasmine Rodgers
[00:00.000][by:dsfsefes]
[00:00.500]编曲 : Bôa
[00:01.010]作曲 : Lee Sullivan
[00:01.520]And you don't seem to understand
[00:01.520]你似乎不明白
[00:06.170]A shame you seemed an honest man
[00:06.170]你似乎是个诚恳的人
[00:11.230]And all the fears you hold so dear
[00:11.230]你所抑制的恐惧已无以复加
[00:16.450]Will turn to whisper in your ear
[00:16.450]它们的低语萦绕在你的耳际
[00:21.400]And you know what they say might hurt you
[00:21.400]你知道它们所说的可能会伤害到你
[00:24.130]And you know that it means so much
[00:24.130]而且你知道那意味着太多
[00:26.550]And you don't even feel a thing
[00:26.550]你却什么也感受不到
[00:31.480]I am falling, I am fading,
[00:31.480]我在坠落，在凋谢
[00:37.170]I have lost it all
[00:37.170]我失去了一切
[00:42.060]And you don't seem the lying kind
[00:42.060]你看起来并不像一个撒谎的人
[00:47.090]A shame then I can read your mind
[00:47.090]在我读出你的内心后却发现了愧疚
[00:52.170]And all the things that I read there
[00:52.170]我在你心中读出了一切
[00:57.420]Candle lit smile that we both share
[00:57.420]我们一起分享烛光与微笑
[01:02.330]And you know I don't mean to hurt you
[01:02.330]你知道我并没有伤害你的意思
[01:05.000]But you know that it means so much
[01:05.000]但你知道那意味着太多
[01:07.560]And you don't even feel a thing
[01:07.560]你却什么也感受不到
